# medmate Bruno

- One folder per module, one request file per operation.
- Record only endpoints the server actually serves.
- Keep example values in `environments/`. Reuse `examplePharmacyId`, `examplePhone`, and `exampleRequestId`.
- Environment files contain only `vars` (and optional `@description` lines). Do not add a `meta` block; Bruno 4 ignores the file and the values show up empty.
- Assert the status code and the response fields the endpoint guarantees.
- Point requests at `{{baseUrl}}` so local and production environments both work.
